description	"Sabe

One of Queen Amidala's decoy handmaidens trained in the arts of healing allies.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- ELG-3A Diplomat's Pistol (3)
-- 10% more damage/FP damage
-- 20% faster RoF
- 2 Pulse Grenades

^5Powers:
- Team Heal (1)

^6Inventory:
- Advanced Medpac ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- 5% more knockback given
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (2)
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Ally Stat Viewer

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (3) ^3[CS3]

Sabe was a female human who served as a Royal Handmaiden during the Trade Federation's invasion of Naboo. As a handmaiden for Queen Padme Amidala, Sabe doubled as the queen's decoy, often switching roles for her monarch's protection. Sabe carried out this role during the invasion, using it to trick the Federation into believing she was the queen."